tack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>, damage, and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw#The_Difficulty_Class_of_Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Spell Save DC</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rhapsody\" title=\"Rhapsody\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Rhapsody_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Rhapsody\" title=\"Rhapsody\">Rhapsody</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanguine_Blade\" title=\"Sanguine Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Rapier_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sanguine_Blade\" title=\"Sanguine Blade\">Sanguine Blade</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>As of Patch 5, Scarlet Remittance only works when killing living, hostile targets. Previously, this feature would trigger on anything with a healthbar, including objects like crates and pouches.</li>\n<li>A creature wielding a weapon with Scarlet Remittance loses the bonus when the passive feature becomes unequipped.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195325\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2429/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27521/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6147/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand si